This license applies to the source code of the Opsdeck dashboard in this
repository ("the Software"). It is not an open source license.

1. What you may do

   Solo license (one purchase, one project)
   - Use the Software for one product or one client project.
   - Modify the code, the design and the content without limit.
   - Deploy the result to your own Cloudflare account (Pages, Workers, D1).
   - Keep the modifications private.

   Studio license (one purchase, unlimited projects)
   - Everything in the Solo license.
   - Use the Software for any number of your own or client projects.
   - Rebrand it (name, colours, logo) and hand the finished dashboard to a
     client as part of your service.

2. What you may not do

   - Resell, sublicense or redistribute the Software as a template, starter
     kit, boilerplate or source code product, whether modified or not.
   - Publish the source code publicly (for example on GitHub) in a form that
     allows others to download and reuse it.
   - Include the Software in a competing template or theme marketplace listing.
   - Use the Opsdeck name or logo for your own product without written
     permission.

3. Deliverables and payments

   - One-time payment, no subscription. Prices and what is included are listed
     on the sales page.
   - Included: full source code, database schema, API, documentation, and
     twelve months of updates for the purchased version line.

